<title>JAPAN: Yamaichi Electronics - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yamaichi Electronics - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.96		vs	   10.95</p>
<p> Operating	  977 million	 vs	    1.17</p>
<p> Current		1.26		vs	    1.18</p>
<p> Net		  648 million	 vs	  516 million</p>
<p> EPS		   54.70 yen	  vs	   43.59 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     12 million	  vs	  12 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yamaichi Electronics Co Ltd is a leading manufacturer of integrated circuit sockets.</p>
</text>
